@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 34

title VoteTrust Election Lifecycle - State Pattern

class ElectionService <<Service>> {
  +transition(actor, electionId, action, password, input): Election
  +transitionFromAdminApi(actor, electionId, action, input): Election
  +availability(election, at): array
}

class ElectionLifecycle <<Context>> {
  -election: Election
  -state: ElectionState
  +transition(action, context): void
  +moveTo(stateName, action, metadata): void
}

interface ElectionState <<State>> {
  +name(): string
  +label(): string
  +actions(election): array
  +canRegisterCandidate(election, now): bool
  +canVote(election, now): bool
  +apply(lifecycle, action, context): void
}

abstract class AbstractElectionState
class DraftState
class PendingPaymentState
class PendingAdminApprovalState
class NominationOpenState
class VotingOpenState
class ClosedState
class CancelledState
class RejectedState
class ElectionStateFactory <<Factory>>
class TransitionContext
interface PaymentGateway
class HttpPaymentGateway
class Election <<Shared ORM Entity>>
class User <<Shared ORM Entity>> {
  +isAdmin(): bool
}

ElectionService --> ElectionLifecycle : invokes
ElectionLifecycle o-- Election : owns lifecycle entity
ElectionLifecycle o-- ElectionState : current behaviour
ElectionLifecycle --> ElectionStateFactory : restores persisted state
ElectionStateFactory ..> ElectionState : creates concrete state

ElectionState <|.. AbstractElectionState
AbstractElectionState <|-- DraftState
AbstractElectionState <|-- PendingPaymentState
AbstractElectionState <|-- PendingAdminApprovalState
AbstractElectionState <|-- NominationOpenState
AbstractElectionState <|-- VotingOpenState
AbstractElectionState <|-- ClosedState
AbstractElectionState <|-- CancelledState
AbstractElectionState <|-- RejectedState

DraftState -[hidden]down- PendingPaymentState
PendingPaymentState -[hidden]down- PendingAdminApprovalState
PendingAdminApprovalState -[hidden]down- NominationOpenState
VotingOpenState -[hidden]down- ClosedState
ClosedState -[hidden]down- CancelledState
CancelledState -[hidden]down- RejectedState
DraftState -[hidden]right- VotingOpenState

ElectionState ..> TransitionContext : actor and transition data
TransitionContext o-- PaymentGateway
TransitionContext o-- User : current actor
PaymentGateway <|.. HttpPaymentGateway
PendingPaymentState --> PaymentGateway : verifies hosting fee
PendingAdminApprovalState --> User : requires independent admin

note bottom of ElectionLifecycle
  Persisted transition path:
  DRAFT -> PENDING_PAYMENT -> PENDING_ADMIN_APPROVAL
  -> NOMINATION_OPEN -> VOTING_OPEN -> CLOSED
  CANCELLED and REJECTED are terminal.
end note
@enduml
